 "title": "100 V, 150 mA fast switching diode in SOD-523",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A single fast switching diode in the two-terminal SOD-523 surface-mount package. It blocks 100 V repetitive reverse, carries 150 mA average forward current, dissipates up to 150 mW at 25 °C and recovers in 4 ns at most. It is meant for low-voltage, high-frequency signal circuits. The package is marked T4, a band marks the cathode, and the device is rated MSL 1 with a 260 °C lead-free reflow peak.",
