 "operation": [
  {
   "topic": "Construction and handling",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The SOD-523 body is moulded in a UL 94V-0 compound; the part is RoHS-compliant and halogen-free. Terminals are solder plated and pass the MIL-STD-750 method 2026 solderability test. Moisture sensitivity is level 1 per J-STD-020, with a lead-free reflow peak of 260 °C."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Power derating",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "The full 150 mW holds up to 25 °C ambient and falls linearly to zero at 150 °C."
  }
